From: X Brut MicroPython build compatibility
Subject: [PATCH] esp32: use esp_libc with ESP-IDF 6

ESP-IDF 6 renamed the `newlib` component to `esp_libc`.  The X4 build
environment provides ESP-IDF 6, so use the current component name.

--- a/ports/esp32/esp32_common.cmake
+++ b/ports/esp32/esp32_common.cmake
@@ -189,7 +189,7 @@ idf_component_register(
     lwip
     mbedtls
-    newlib
+    esp_libc
     nvs_flash
    sdmmc
    spi_flash

@@ -196,7 +196,6 @@ idf_component_register(
     soc
     spi_flash
     ulp
-    usb
     vfs
 )
